#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SDL2"
msgstr "Instalação do SDL2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>SDL2</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>SDL2</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> installed and want to build the html"
" documentation, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> instalado e quiser construir a "
"documentação HTML, execute os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd docs  &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen   &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd docs  &amp;&amp;\n"
"  doxygen   &amp;&amp;\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to build and run the package regression tests, do not delete the"
" static libraries below until after the tests are built."
msgstr ""
"Se você desejar construir e executar os testes de regressão do pacote, não "
"delete as bibliotecas estáticas abaixo até depois que os testes sejam "
"construídos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:148
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install              &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -v /usr/lib/libSDL2*.a</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install              &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -v /usr/lib/libSDL2*.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:152
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you built the documentation, install it as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você construiu a documentação, instale-a como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d        /usr/share/doc/SDL2-&sdl2-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv  docs/output/html/* /usr/share/doc/SDL2-&sdl2-version;/html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m755 -d        /usr/share/doc/SDL2-&sdl2-version;/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -Rv  docs/output/html/* /usr/share/doc/SDL2-&sdl2-version;/html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "Testing SDL2"
msgstr "Testando a SDL2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you wish to, test the installation of <application>SDL2</application> "
"using the included test programs.  None of the resulting binaries need to be"
" installed.  Issue the following commands to build the test programs:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejar, teste a instalação do <application>SDL2</application> usando os "
"aplicativos de teste incluídos. Nenhum dos binários resultantes precisa ser "
"instalado. Emita os seguintes comandos para construir os aplicativos de "
"teste:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:172
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cd test &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cd test &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:177
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Each of the test programs (they are listed in the "
"<filename>README</filename> file in this directory) will need to be run "
"individually.  Many of them will need to be manually killed. Additionally, "
"speakers need to be on with the volume at a suitable level."
msgstr ""
"Cada um dos aplicativos de teste (eles estão listados no arquivo "
"<filename>README</filename> nesse diretório) precisará ser executado "
"individualmente. Muitos deles precisarão ser eliminados manualmente. Além "
"disso, os alto-falantes precisam estar ligados e com o volume em um nível "
"adequado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:189
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>rm -v /usr/lib/libSDL2*.a</command>: Normally static libraries can "
"be disabled with a <option>--disable-static</option> option to configure, "
"but that breaks the build in this package."
msgstr ""
"<command>rm -v /usr/lib/libSDL2*.a</command>: Normalmente bibliotecas "
"estáticas podem ser desabilitadas com uma opção <option>--disable-"
"static</option> para o configure, mas isso interrompe a construção nesse "
"pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-alsa-shared</option>: This switch disables dynamically "
"loading ALSA shared libraries."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-alsa-shared</option>: Essa chave desabilita o carregamento"
" dinâmico de bibliotecas compartilhadas ALSA."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-sdl-dlopen</option>: This switch disables using dlopen for"
" shared object loading. Loading image backend libraries like libpng "
"dynamically on the fly does not work."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-sdl-dlopen</option>: Essa chave desabilita usar dlopen "
"para carregamento de objetos compartilhados. Carregar bibliotecas de "
"estrutura de retaguarda de imagens, como a libpng, dinamicamente em tempo "
"real não funciona."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/sdl2.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-x11-shared</option>: This switch disables dynamically "
"loading X11 shared libraries."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-x11-shared</option>: Essa chave desabilita o carregamento "
"dinâmico de bibliotecas compartilhadas do X11."

